    "detailed_description": "You are unlucky resident of the Hotel's Cursed Floor 13. Reach 1st Floor and escape from this endless cursed loop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Look for Anomalies <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- If you find an anomaly use Red Elevator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- If Floor has no anomalies use Green Elevator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Reach 1st Floor to escape from Cursed Floor 13<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCursed Places: Hotel Floor 13 is a short walking simulator inspired by Exit 8. Game is available only in English.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay Time<br />\r\n15-60 minutes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOption<br />\r\nGraphics settings, mouse sensitivity and other settings can be configured from the options.<br />\r\nIf you are easily intoxicated, changing the following settings may help.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Camera Sensitivity\u3011<br />\r\nIf the sensitivity is high, the camera will move significantly when the mouse is moved.<br />\r\nAdjust the value if you find it difficult to operate the camera. The default value is 50.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Preset\u3011<br />\r\nSet the overall graphic settings.<br />\r\nIf you do not have sufficient specs, it is better to set it to &quot;Low&quot; to avoid lags.",
    "about_the_game": "You are unlucky resident of the Hotel's Cursed Floor 13. Reach 1st Floor and escape from this endless cursed loop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Look for Anomalies <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- If you find an anomaly use Red Elevator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- If Floor has no anomalies use Green Elevator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Reach 1st Floor to escape from Cursed Floor 13<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCursed Places: Hotel Floor 13 is a short walking simulator inspired by Exit 8. Game is available only in English.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay Time<br />\r\n15-60 minutes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOption<br />\r\nGraphics settings, mouse sensitivity and other settings can be configured from the options.<br />\r\nIf you are easily intoxicated, changing the following settings may help.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Camera Sensitivity\u3011<br />\r\nIf the sensitivity is high, the camera will move significantly when the mouse is moved.<br />\r\nAdjust the value if you find it difficult to operate the camera. The default value is 50.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Preset\u3011<br />\r\nSet the overall graphic settings.<br />\r\nIf you do not have sufficient specs, it is better to set it to &quot;Low&quot; to avoid lags.",
